BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hb100-w01-1-2026-10-20@tce-founder.ultra
DTSTAMP:20261018T222526Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T181500
SUMMARY:W1 · Strength A — heavy lower (45m)
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 · Base 1 — tissue tolerance\\n\\nBack squat or trap-b
 ar deadlift 4x5 @ heavy. Romanian deadlift 3x6. Standing calf raise 3x8 he
 avy. Weighted step-up 3x6/leg. HIGH LOAD\, low reps\, long rests — the m
 eta-analyses found high-load and combined formats improved running economy
  and submaximal/isometric circuits did not.
CATEGORIES:STRENGTH
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hb100-w01-2-2026-10-20@tce-founder.ultra
