BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hb100-w01-4-2026-10-22@tce-founder.ultra
DTSTAMP:20261018T222526Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T181500
SUMMARY:W1 · Strength B — unilateral + eccentric (45m)
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 · Base 1 — tissue tolerance\\n\\nBulgarian split squa
 t 3x8/leg. Single-leg RDL 3x8/leg. ECCENTRIC step-down 3x10/leg\, 4 s lowe
 ring — this is the Hellbender-specific one\; the race's damage is quadri
 ceps braking on descents. Calf raise\, bent-knee 3x12. Side plank 3x40 s.
CATEGORIES:STRENGTH
END:VEVENT
