SUMMARY:W9 · Vert session — stair machine or treadmill incline (55m)
DESCRIPTION:Week 9 · Base 2 — aerobic volume + vert · 420 ft vert\\n\\n
 Stair machine (StepMill) preferred — far steeper than a treadmill's 15% 
 ceiling. DO NOT hold the handrail\; it removes a large and unrecorded shar
 e of the work. Treadmill at max incline is the alternative. Neither trains
  DESCENDING\, which is what actually breaks down at Hellbender — that is
  what the mountain weekends and the eccentric strength work are for.
