DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270221T063000
SUMMARY:W18 · Rest — walk only if you want to
DESCRIPTION:Week 18 · Specific — mountain\, dark\, fuelled\\n\\nDay afte
 r a big effort. Eat\, sleep\, drive home gently. Nothing you do today impr
 oves May\; plenty of things could cost it.
CATEGORIES:REST
END:VEVENT
