DESCRIPTION:Week 19 · Specific — mountain\, dark\, fuelled\\n\\nBack squ
 at or trap-bar deadlift 4x5 @ heavy. Romanian deadlift 3x6. Standing calf 
 raise 3x8 heavy. Weighted step-up 3x6/leg. HIGH LOAD\, low reps\, long res
 ts — the meta-analyses found high-load and combined formats improved run
 ning economy and submaximal/isometric circuits did not.
CATEGORIES:STRENGTH
