SUMMARY:W22 · Mount Mitchell Heartbreaker 50M (13h30)
DESCRIPTION:Week 22 · Specific — mountain\, dark\, fuelled · 12\,000 ft
  vert\\n\\nTHE DRESS REHEARSAL. Starts at Camp Grier — the same start li
 ne as Hellbender. ~12\,000 ft\, 5:30 am start\, 16.5 h cutoff. Climbs Mt M
 itchell via the Black Mountain Crest and finishes over Heartbreak Ridge\, 
 so it is Hellbender terrain at race effort. Full kit\, full race fuelling\
 , nothing untested.
CATEGORIES:RACE
LOCATION:Camp Grier\, Old Fort\, NC
END:VEVENT
