SUMMARY:Mobility — 15 min
DESCRIPTION:Ankle dorsiflexion against a wall 10/side. Calf and soleus stre
 tch 45 s each. Couch stretch 60 s/side. 90/90 hip rotations 10/side. Thora
 cic rotations 10/side.\n\nHonest framing: the evidence that stretching pre
 vents running injury is weak. This is here for ankle and hip range you act
 ually need on technical descents\, and because a short daily anchor keeps 
 the rest of the routine attached to something.
CATEGORIES:MOBILITY
